Roth claimed "the average (Wisconsin) resident’s tax burden is at its lowest level in nearly 50 years, while incomes continue to grow."  The numbers check out. While tax collections are up, incomes have been growing at a faster rate than taxes. Thus, the tax burden continues to edge down. We rate his  . window.gciAnalyticsUAID = 'PMJS-TEALIUM-COBRAND';
