In an ad that aired in Wisconsin, the League of Conservation Voters claimed Trump has opposed plans to clean up "toxic chemicals that cause cancer (that) are in the water …. (and) put Wisconsin at risk." Trump’s administration is opposed to the pending PFAS Action Act, and the ad made clear that is the measure it was referring to. That said, he has signed another measure that addresses the chemicals. Indeed, some parts of the proposed law overlap with what was signed. We rate the  . window.gciAnalyticsUAID = 'PMJS-TEALIUM-COBRAND';
